  "text_md": "<!-- image -->\n\n## GREATER GOOD INTERNSHIP FUND APPLICATION FORM\n\nThis form must be e-mailed with all other required documents to Megan Boris (mtboris@iu.edu) no later than 5pm on Friday, April 2Oth, 2018. Put GREATER GOOD INTERNSHIP FUND in the subject line. Applications with incomplete information or missing documents will not be considered.\n\n## Contact Information\n\nName\n\nLocal Address\n\nCity\\_\n\nState\n\nZip\n\nPhone\n\nE-mail\n\nStudent ID (10-digit) #\n\n## Academic Standing\n\nClass\n\nDegree\n\nMajor(s)\n\nMinor(s)\n\n#of Credits Completed\n\nGraduation Date (Mo/Yr)\n\n## Reference\n\nList the name, telephone number and e-mail for the faculty member who will be writing a letter of reference for you:\n\nName\n\nPhone\n\nE-mail\n\n## Internship Details\n\nOrganization\n\nInternship Start date\n\nEnd date\n\nLocation\n\nSupervisor Name\n\nPhone\n\nE-mail\n\nconfirm that information on this form is correct and accurate.\n\nSIGNATURE\n\nDATE",
